Z||000002||Songman||07-08-2001||07:12 PM||||How are you scanning them? If you have a TWAIN-compliant scanner, the best thing to do is scan them directly into Photoshop and the "Save For Web' which set them to the correct 72dpi for web viewing.<P>You can also open bmp's in Photoshop and Save As different formats. Photoshop is far and away the best but other graphic programs should do this as well.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
